00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:19,540
「ライブステージをもっと近くで見てみたい。広場に行こう」行くのじゃー！
"I want to see the live stage up close. Let's head to the plaza." Let's go!

436
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:23,840
ほらジャンプで、草むら歩けるの面白！草むらあるよ！
Look, jumping into the grass—walking through the grass is so fun! There's a grassy field!

437
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:30,940
葉っぱ舞ってるよ！何、しかも、わしが草むら歩くと葉っぱ舞うよ？何この作り込み！？
Leaves are fluttering! Wait, what? And when I walk through the grass, leaves flutter up?! What is this level of detail?!

438
