音ゲーじゃようなし？
This is a rhythm game, right, guys?

439
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:37,040
音ゲーをやってるよ、わしは。
I'm playing a rhythm game, aren't I?

440
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:41,540
嘘じゃろ？見て！見てこの、
You've gotta be kidding me! Look! Look at this...

441
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:46,540
葉っぱが舞ってる。海も見れる。鳥も飛んでる！嘘でしょ！？
Leaves are scattering. You can see the ocean. Birds are flying too! Are you serious?!

442
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:49,040
何？
What even?

443
00:29:49,540 --> 00:29:54,940
あ、可愛い。モクモクが出る。走るとモクモクが出る。すごいな！
Ah, so cute! Dust clouds appear. When she runs, little puffs of dust come out. That's awesome!

444
00:29:56,040 --> 00:30:00,040
島も可愛い。まだなんもないのかな？ステージ...
The island is cute too. Is there nothing here yet? The stage...

445
00:30:00,268 --> 00:30:01,928
噴水以外はあんまりないのかな？
I wonder if there's not much here besides the fountain?

446
00:30:02,148 --> 00:30:04,188
え、どんどん発展させていこう的な？
Wait, is it like we develop it as we go?

447
00:30:04,468 --> 00:30:06,548
発展させていく的な感じか？
Is that the vibe, that you develop it?

448
00:30:07,168 --> 00:30:09,228
え？音ゲーじゃないだろ ガチで！
Wait, there's no way this is just a rhythm game, seriously!

449
00:30:09,328 --> 00:30:10,548
すごいな！
That's incredible!

450
00:30:11,248 --> 00:30:12,848
あ、BGM変わった！
Ah, the BGM changed!

451
00:30:13,148 --> 00:30:15,348
いるフロアによって変わる感じか？
