501
00:33:14,148 --> 00:33:18,048
あの野外ステージみたいな音のさ、スピーカーいいよな。
having speaker audio that sounds like an outdoor stage is great.

502
00:33:18,448 --> 00:33:19,948
雰囲気出るよな。
It really creates an atmosphere.

503
00:33:20,448 --> 00:33:22,048
え、すごーい！
Whoa, amazing!

504
